<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#HeritageRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Heritage Relationship"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#method-community-consensus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Community deliberation and consensus"@en .
