<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#targetTradition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Afro-Atlantic tradition this movement seeks to reclaim or revitalize. Range: iroko:TraditionScheme concept."@en .
