<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#rel-direct-descent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#type-decolonization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Specifically framed efforts to identify and remove colonial impositions (Catholic syncretism, colonial-era secrecy requirements, European naming conventions) from a Afro-Atlantic tradition. Overlaps with re-Africanization but emphasizes the political critique of colonialism."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#method-ethnographic> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Published ethnographic sources"@en .
